:null,"call_locator":"d41e40b656ced26458cbd8e4e780db9a8c7665a649b82843662bf6110b54941f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"49dd8010eb37b3149167129f70580907f1af4d86d07bedec33a40bfe69bd7b28","logical_entry_identity":"a71e5a433e3a279e05b2dd8210f8f780f1da39a43b776cddcb10acfa7973e668","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"See what the rune in the next room has to teach you! Hopefully you can use it to get past the troublesome elves ahead.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"看看下一个房间里的符文会教给你什么！希望你能用它越过前方那些麻烦的精灵。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"358acfd3e350e2d08bebf61f84071a807c10f0720fada1e8d5b01d6d7d992e7c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"49ddb54ed325075704d36a87dd4bdc0bfdba0d956c4e0c0eb1fb586825910073","logical_entry_identity":"42198db3fe1b89fd3d30fd32084a6702ad318a92ee104bb8522a5e8d4d449e8f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Clarity","source_tag":"_t","target":"唯我论：明晰"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"835044160c5691e8704d56f87b0fafbde2768d00c2c77f1f2a76762cc57ca7d7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"49ec3e2cf0a2540a2fe533b93b3bf7f9af2c859a3f88283b6bcd7230ae248648","logical_entry_identity":"75f8c0e4ab05fa5b2ab58073e2e5ee9f76d24a63411f9259a3f8360d11f19077","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"giant yellow ant","source_tag":"entity name","target":"黄色巨蚁"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e0818d6901ae89f4c539a83e0d395fe7f1843a6b08172a50f14a4f39a56598a4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"49ed2abdb990cc88ea28f4336fe89e2697be7ee617b46ae3d93b0319715b3b5d","logical_entry_identity":"6336b96123c59f1a399319cb6bdb7c05b0f855ad8d2c12d28e9626c80604fe01","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Select Prepared Traps","source_tag":"_t","target":"选择准备的陷阱"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ba9d65c117a0a98cf0ebceb836fdbaf9dd66059c413aa54ff9c95699483a32db","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"49f108d0735cf28129a1140f4513b58617311d30fdd46e6f10d7ed25491640d3","logical_entry_identity":"899aa970db965f0e66a29a49cff13df4ef58c921f25c5609fe8ce6e9633e6c8b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}#\"The Necromancer's Canticle\"\n\n#{italic}#Saved from coffin, casket, urn\nDarkness falls, but life returns!\nFlesh may fall and bone may burn\nBut soul remains, for which we yearn\n\nThose we return to life's esteem\nWe see their hearts, their eyes do gleam\nThey rave! They kill! They gnash! They scream!\nSo full of joy! Their greatest dream!\n\nReturning those that we amend\nThey hurry home, a distant friend\nBut do they cheer? Do they commend?\nThey yell! Does rotting flesh offend?\n\nWe bring life to lifeless bone\nBut do they smile? Do they condone?\nThey sit upon their golden thrones\nThey shun us, spurn us, make unknown\n\nFools! Sit high in golden tower\nFrom your lofty perch you glower\nTime will come when you will cower\nWe rule death, we wield the power\n#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#“死灵法师颂歌”\n\n#{italic}#从棺木、灵柩、骨灰瓮中救出\n黑暗降临，生命却再度复苏！\n血肉或会崩坏，骸骨或被焚烧\n唯有灵魂长存，那正是我们所渴求\n\n我们让他们重获生命的尊荣\n看见他们心潮涌动，双眼闪亮\n他们狂呼！杀戮！咬牙！尖叫！\n多么欢欣！那正是他们最大的梦想！\n\n我们修补他们，令其重归人世\n他们匆匆返乡，去见远方故友\n可他们会欢呼吗？会赞扬吗？\n他们只会叫嚷！难道腐肉如此冒犯？\n\n我们把生命带给无生的白骨\n可他们会微笑吗？会赞同吗？\n他们高坐金色王座\n躲避我们，唾弃我们，装作不知\n\n蠢货！尽管高踞金塔\n从高高的栖身处怒视我们\n总有一天，你们必将畏缩\n我们统御死亡，我们手握力量\n#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"99f50cd8bf0c8a2ad389ea03461fb7c6eef9b1971a840f6e8f99ee914a9c429d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"49f7781bff7a125f3f99d733ef59e99ed9696796f78cb3bfdcac513f345addb5","logical_entry_identity":"4140c55e7257ea1370c830d6dc7a53abc09b0286d5c515680bfe9e6c4fda29d0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s the level %d %s %s %s on level %s of %s.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"玩家%s 等级%d %s %s %s 死在%s层，%s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dbd40c62646c1cfb5bec1a68824ef95a7cd9022cecea266ef9e6a5aa11c3935d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"49f7882638a3c16bb2194fb36c7ba719a3c4aadb16cd199131e354c5db0e742b","logical_entry_identity":"895db68a608d30c94a20aefdece43c8b2728890dcc55ecef944250c1bbd58b5c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"archery - bows","source_tag":"talent type","target":"弓"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f518699b652180bf613910a13a99ff9501c1e0cfc12075c7a5c925d8e4e3493a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"49f91cad7eb281bde370bd58c03374ddbf817ea5c93ba0db67937d275d10f8d0","logical_entry_identity":"32d0d82981e7f696c3344dfca889de8384fecbcc4694f40865e205b350924bb7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The massive ribcage in the middle beats with loud, audible cracks, as many a skeletal hand protrude forth, entwining, fusing, forming long skeletal appendages to support itself, while others crumble and collapse inward. During all this, somehow, it seems they grasp for you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"中央的巨大胸腔伴随着响亮而清晰的碎裂声搏动着，许多骷髅手臂从中伸出，缠绕、融合，形成长长的骨骼肢体支撑自身，而其他部分则崩塌向内坍缩。在此期间，它们似乎都想抓住你。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2055e538fd11c4f769fb28abf7ac5dca9144dca0fde841ff975bf75cb6c390bd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"49f9bf48f06404df1047cd2c1e943d83c1112da177d81572fcf3ef9d08c5f87c","logical_entry_identity":"2d53dc53e1dcf5cb750903cde8a908866ec160e85938d57ead99dc17ab9d2a22","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Here's a list of the ingredients I'm missing. Please attempt to not lose your life in their pursuit. I'll be most put out if I must wait another year.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这是我所缺少的原料清单。搜寻它们时请尽量保住性命，要是还得再等上一年，我可会非常不快的。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4463dc96c1796493a6657fe55ee209a1ffe6b000ecddd52aafe69d8701a81aa2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"49fc9db3bb41804c84aedba7e69604edc95f1d84b9cbc1485499d21785afce7a","logical_entry_identity":"628a6600b3b89109253ec2a582a947fe31a55a4130f45f59f2cd4ad6c804bf4f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Strike twice with your mainhand weapon dealing %d%% Arcane damage.\n\t\tIf either of these attacks hit you gain %d mana.\n\t\tThe mana gain will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"使用你的主手武器打击两次目标，造成 %d%% 奥术伤害。\n\t\t如果任何一击命中目标，你获得 %d 法力值。\n\t\t法力值恢复受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4347951984383df23a4d69137d24c91abe07ad4580d3311aa316be9a3f6f60c2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a022dc3283d32ce88bb9e1f4ede15690c21c36f93f6b3ac9008c45ca9c778ee","logical_entry_identity":"f002e5894f0d48d89c05be5febb4ccd2ab45c15117546385de6979fc703c3963","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Orcs! Ah! Well then this is your lucky day. This whole continent is swarming with Orcs. They have united as the Orc Pride and, according to rumour, their masters are powerful.\nThey roam the lands freely, ever assaulting us.\n@playername@, you have helped one of ours. I grant you access to the Gates of Morning and name you friend of the Sunwall.","source_tag":"_t","target":"兽人！啊！那今天可真是你的幸运日。整片大陆到处都是兽人。他们联合组成了兽人部落，据传言，他们背后的主人十分强大。\n他们在这片土地上肆意游荡，不断袭击我们。\n@playername@，你帮助了我们的一位同胞。我准许你进入晨曦之门，并封你为太阳堡垒之友。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eb582818489c19e55e341143d8044d127596ff587115668b78080c26125b36fa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a0247c61714ea07e8e80742e6b4f77fb0319fa8a0950b0c4bc2b6dd34629f6d","logical_entry_identity":"469f68cfbf5c7cc0bb9ecc6706c815dc2fe7aafa73e424bf482861c103636ee4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Bombardment","source_tag":"talent name","target":"连环炮击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aee87c48ebd1a3c07762dce5f2350b0ea8260d3334b4b34bb9807a433c750a9c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a028a4a0f42785567b0805f49275a90bdb32d1afd6e94e6811c8e002793346c","logical_entry_identity":"b6ff298e3a00e65afabe39cc294c1555d58a159f8c8e8e2d3499d1788033ef22","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Smelly Toxin?  What kind of smell?","source_tag":"_t","target":"恶臭毒素？什么样的气味？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"45406e2d61c0187496c507b109b617f053e8932e97d7df0598b3247173e9eb9b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a028d12e45851e0743a1afb83bfd53df763ba332de5bae0c014ffad55feb2c4","logical_entry_identity":"b1767c4f7dd0ecca4dd89d04237522341057cdb05d56f93d5c9ad6db4b96591b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#F53CBE##Target# is in despair!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#F53CBE##Target#陷入绝望！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"62b66d161064177c9044e7620cb23ce20a72923d453c824e4363c7d399156bf4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a03387e2676ed5725aa248ad42cbde5f9706eec6040090ea7f54e3b0e722a27","logical_entry_identity":"74e6020e872c3899ce2fb2de6bd80a47424ad1cf3315dc206bb93dfe962b724e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of thunder","source_tag":"entity name","target":"闪电之"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"22d9bff0c44dd319e74066f685b4dc4062a17b99dc08f7db7486082c2c9704d1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a036312a49ec6151d43b12643f98f32f67f8d39799aa8678b12797b8b210450","logical_entry_identity":"7920e9f0b44b251c2671c3e3088c7dc1ff455b135eb9e307f1c177d8b70f1ef7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Tether","source_tag":"_t","target":"-系绳"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1bb026a3ca7e58078b4110997f13fcbbc28d97b2f8db9ce62e28cd41245c6335","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a08dd04bb9ca72f2b9b2e89ef07f9f5fc4969c3f432fca14ba4e8df3ab9eb4b","logical_entry_identity":"85024c9e9fcdeebcd3115fdb867a7c3e0e7c793f40fa8ea8469e8830a875d22e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Night Terror","source_tag":"talent name","target":"梦魇降临"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7e60cf59faa61447d3683edcb464a6478901c0057bbc24c967b55f8a41c68dfb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a09cf6ca6ccd82a86ce51e3e931de8bd0ab40da64f80cdad0d4f000356eb677","logical_entry_identity":"2897fa131ac99085deabda33cd429334d8bbbfb0f866cef78b79570963940909","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Though the sharp point of an arrow pointed steadily at your head is of concern, more unnerving is the creature that wields it: a slim and lithe woman from the waist up, but a terrifying giant serpent beneath, her tail stretching for several feet behind her. Her eyes turn cold and ice seems to magically condense on the tip of her barbed arrow. Suddenly it is of concern again.","source_tag":"_t","target":"尽管一支利箭稳稳地指着你的脑袋令人担忧，但更让人不安的是握着它的生物：上半身是一个纤细柔美的女人，下半身却是可怕的巨蛇，尾巴在身后延伸数英尺。她的眼神变得冰冷，冰似乎神奇地凝结在她带刺箭矢的尖端。突然间，那箭矢又令你心生恐惧了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dfc6e2d1d239f597c68712a6b1bb1aaacd87e06f073ef952084cf9ffcf5f43e3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a1089edc2461fda127780b9410880306ec277092efc3460a9bcec35a6e91471","logical_entry_identity":"413b0208645b2965899734cc3767027ff9aee92959e7d4723eba7811bd8a8d2c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You smack your forehead against your enemy's head (or whatever sensitive part you can find), causing %0.1f Physical damage.\n\t\tIf the attack hits, the target is confused (%d%% effect) for %d turns.\n\t\tDamage done increases with the quality of your headgear, your Strength, and your physical damage bonuses.\n\t\tConfusion power increases with your Dexterity, and chance increases with Accuracy.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你用前额猛击敌人头部（或者任意你能找到的有效位置），造成 %0.1f 物理伤害。如果\n\t\t此次攻击命中，则目标会混乱(%d%% 强度) %d 回合。\n\t\t伤害受头盔品质、力量和物理伤害加成。\n\t\t混乱强度受敏捷加成，几率受命中加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8ee46af4cdd625caebd851ddfe72d35881bb6dc793170e1be0f290240f6348af","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a110e5414dbbb2ac156091bf2b500eddc782d4cba1530891c2fe7063a93734d","logical_entry_identity":"39432aab081ed7564ff38a6a93f121cf1ee6ce465779be4b1daa1d7abeddd1d3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#CRIMSON#[Your mind is burnt by your patron sun! Fight for your sun god now!]","source_tag":"_t","target":"#CRIMSON#[你的心智已被太阳主上焚毁！现在就为你的太阳神而战！]"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"653e5fcb5b8a8c069f59211fce69d74b506eca33f34f04ac9a1b4ca7fc88b855","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a174979b1cdcb5125353fb459c5c031ca6d6e38df97967e4dda94f7c577efac","logical_entry_identity":"9c7cc3bdf89421ff2aa64513a1906978d7e0bf29b3eba5be6610ffff515d9be1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dozing","source_tag":"_t","target":"打盹"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"afbf73469100d72339d3f8a9fdf29b9c3a719397c120c8241911c4f5a4ee2b12","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a191e116de1ec345c017ca404db4df750300505cb23ec78afa193cea63c41ea","logical_entry_identity":"a022afedc8ba281d402ee94cf2635c144e02bb8bae5c86e56696a41ce7d74413","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"innervating","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"提神"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5f9e6e0817d64e6eb84bce3378ccd41be74c9a4bd8c6513b64d036b23b025750","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a199896353a054b7c4f0e7a81fa416b1037db33f19f6a9f8be5aa2cac7f9dfd","logical_entry_identity":"f46287fb9198006d4258628405d1a338d3f1f14af8a6e37e576a1d033161ffc1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This intricate spell erects a space distortion around the caster that is linked to another distortion, placed around a target.\n\t\tAny time the caster should take damage, there is a %d%% chance that it will instead be warped by the shield and hit the designated target.\n\t\tOnce the maximum damage (%d) is absorbed, the time runs out (%d turns), or the target dies, the shield will crumble.\n\t\tThe max damage the shield can absorb will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"这个复杂的法术可以扭曲施法者周围的空间，此空间可连接至范围内的另外 1 个目标。\n\t\t任何时候，施法者所承受的伤害有 %d%% 的概率转移给指定连接的目标。\n\t\t一旦吸收伤害达到上限（%d），持续时间到了（%d 回合）或目标死亡，护盾会破碎掉。\n\t\t护盾的伤害最大吸收值受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a5e52c50795101009fdeee59fd7bd0d36f3657754031b9e8aaaba3c59c2ed040","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a248926843b9a549d0147b2a3cf21ee9b9ae01bb108dfe08e050b038c207504","logical_entry_identity":"7b87c6a43fde6f326a6a61fdfc9cb73a21dfe9c585b6565ceddf4ced981d15f2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"(unknown object)","source_tag":"_t","target":"（未知物品）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d99884d6f6d570ba9cf104dcdad28ec1353000b1de5fe8582aef7c980f1a40a5","component":"tome","entry_rev