9e33ac5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You hit your target, doing %d%% damage. If your attack connects, the target is crippled for %d turns, losing %d%% melee, spellcasting and mind speed.\n\t\tThe chance to land the status improves with Accuracy, and the status power improves with Cunning.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你打击你的目标，造成 %d%% 伤害。如果你击中了目标，目标会被残废 %d 回合，降低 %d%% 战斗，法术和精神速度。\n\t\t附加异常状态的几率受命中值提升，异常状态效果受灵巧值提升。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8109ccb7724998f4c9f5b09d669de3be5266200832489af61c530c2684bb6616","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a6c1421e078ef314b74bdd4c1a963e75fbd85a68f3ad84f95859e3402a0a439","logical_entry_identity":"859303ab67339d92fecddef5591a0943eb4c382b9e4e160fc42a5f5917d6bec0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GREY#Removing [%s] %s at (%s, %s)","source_tag":"log","target":"#GREY#移除 [%s] %s 位于 (%s, %s)"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be4f5f9c262305dcee15555f026e02f82ce25abdcfd4c17e5aa609d81fecd9ce","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a723762b2f95eca67717d8596580014b44bbabed2df15665409fa2502f9ae5c","logical_entry_identity":"1f40f93beae33196ee240376358b636d25df75d902a623eec959760a0f1548b9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Strength#LAST#\nStrength defines your character's ability to apply physical force. It increases Physical Power, damage done with heavy weapons, Physical Save, and carrying capacity.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#力量#LAST#\n力量属性影响你的角色的物理能力，提升力量可以提高物理强度，提高使用重型武器造成的伤害，提高物理豁免，同时提高你的负重量。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"377f0ef891830b44bad242e3d6a2c1ffdd48a93bc6aa487bac55d60470941e19","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a7a5fde948c1a428d39642311be0e0ac128e18f41029ec3f46c7d70dfc34c08","logical_entry_identity":"6301a219cda11792d87f6ee483987a0f23c161aacd870a28f44dfad83438c2a8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Puts targets in a radius %d cone into a nightmarish sleep for %d turns, rendering them unable to act.  Every %d points of damage the target suffers will reduce the effect duration by one turn.\n\t\tEach turn, they'll suffer %0.2f darkness damage.  This damage will not reduce the duration of the effect.\n\t\tWhen Nightmare ends, the target will suffer from Insomnia for a number of turns equal to the amount of time it was asleep (up to ten turns max), granting it %d%% sleep immunity for each turn of the Insomnia effect.\n\t\tThe damage threshold and darkness damage will scale with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"使 %d 码锥形范围内的目标进入持续 %d 回合的噩梦，令其无法行动。目标每承受 %d 点伤害减少一回合状态持续时间。\n\t\t每回合目标会受到 %0.2f 暗影伤害。此伤害不会减少噩梦的状态持续时间。\n\t\t当梦魇结束时，目标会饱受失眠的痛苦，持续回合等于已睡眠的回合数（但最多 10 回合），失眠状态的每一个剩余回合数会让目标获得 %d%% 睡眠免疫。\n\t\t伤害临界点和暗影伤害受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"20dd9b9fbd62ecc56bcc6cc598aa77f9952096900f5479613f5cdd9f76cdaa89","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a7bca5e6721698e996147c0af9746fc688824c94335d2aed14c3295dc89161f","logical_entry_identity":"15dac7905306eed9b975907393357abbb7b7e9106bd80acd1e5df462a50ec497","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE# Reset base filter","source_tag":"log","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE# 重设基础筛选器"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"590d9f1ce9efdbf92286c030bce0aa410fcfab3da5a0bf09d9d0a258cbee6f5a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a7c30e7cc713db01d18e8bc6ee72f313a2d97701f1c22edf421df525c9dc5f9","logical_entry_identity":"ecdad286534f83b5c7c65d2748f79aa30e70a1ef14cdefb1b26732e34ab8d7d6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Most weapons are wielded in the main hand.","source_tag":"_t","target":"大部分武器使用主手抓握。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4d277af046ee3f60f8e2e7e91d0da19dda986f7fb2d97cc3529fbccc8b799d7b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a848a196aaf23436212fc879a3f0c4355a0f8f6850e78ed3d86c28bd218ff7f","logical_entry_identity":"fbdb4cf9a510382463449fb33c9dcc751a4069184cd91c767b5cdfb61bbb3c8c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is out of range","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"目标距离太远"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"54a39c7232c0bf0c184e834dee34f0f4a015d10c0b5b14de1c21dbfe4dd25c04","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a912c72cb987420a8bb1b8165c5c65e70348df1f2b3cf802b1d67c201e43166","logical_entry_identity":"cff9a9fdeb3cb0d7bed74f9427aacc1bcb0ea5f512bc71fc62ee82e194d54101","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Rassir's journal part 2","source_tag":"_t","target":"拉希尔的旅行日记 第二部分"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0fd64d5315ec7cdb0c9e5e1706fda0f43bf93c579b2c3f61bae1ce117459a357","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a91e5c5a5d96919b3b609423dc74a95e2b7796173bdf996007f6237808c4d3b","logical_entry_identity":"07e5f7a1597f7c92bdbca5936a638ec2cb3a08176d0f7f6d6b1e16f3d0034e53","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and perverted into a monstrous aberration as a warning to the surface","source_tag":"_t","target":"并被转化成一个恐怖的怪物，作为对地上所有人的警告"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"984bf3770256e16bd6b3512c3cebce450bdd8eecd8b3f340997b71fef45355f9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a97561557a484eddbdfce7455739104e6d1bc92f166eda4411b88f8847d11db","logical_entry_identity":"d1d8fd852d0c517e4470e73a59dab2e732b8f603e47ef487e84c9556ab25c5b6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Defensive Maneuver","source_tag":"_t","target":"-闪避姿态"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9854a172b78eb8c7f5b93d114a05ce5e1496503f201f480c21720660931e32d2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a9911d42124a92b9ddf94246298fcb88fbb9b318f815c64b0f4008e07b43a6f","logical_entry_identity":"c272251391277fcf99f339255e112f440e7cd0af07a74cde8ae52cf6069cca62","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# feels death coming!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#感受到了死亡迫近！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4d13657b911d71f65864eece218a553d3ff735e1076624548ed4797833a48d36","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a99ae2b05a610930dfe6e51d23c9f911fb88aedabfa16d00a5c6d868dcc2f5c","logical_entry_identity":"d60eab283bb22f6442fca9523da71972c4f2c432da0dee97542e5273f35686d2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"That price ... er stuff really stinks ...","source_tag":"_t","target":"这价格……呃，我是说这东西确实够臭的……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"630e410bb9fe438f6f9f419947ad6d74386e7d6927da82edbf73b91ba188850d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a9d379f343f7d60def6d9ffd42c01d25bac072a4748c12f4cb72117ec51b92e","logical_entry_identity":"d58fdee5f53fd896372fa01ed9bcbfffa3c2af35ba6c0cb8b9e8ef1bb61d8c84","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"lower the helmet's visor, blinding yourself (and protecting from other blinds) for 6 turns. If the helmet is taken off, the effect will end early.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"放下头盔的面甲，使你致盲6回合（同时免疫其他致盲效果）。如果脱下这件装备，效果会提前结束。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6f3c15206ce20b43d2b98e60247116f753d1f291a28bf40990a0cc58e6cdbd83","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4aa0c1c1e9926ddee92e0dcdbab3915743ec902a1717b43a29cd2fa55fd3b546","logical_entry_identity":"17238424728cc85f9f3da6ecf8b17c8a09c8f4d9eff0432afe856e5d022b685c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Class points: %s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"职业点：%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fadbca82e1184847415c37505726ff5a580e974113637f89815447ae05de0e59","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4aa2b7c6d59592463ef346ef87db606e506d00cd3bca0e163ef670153d0b1106","logical_entry_identity":"f8fc4f21c9bf2638fbcf476df767ad45a74358271d75c4b559ce4320301eb85e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You cannot use Eldricth Fury without a shield!","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"必须装备一面盾牌！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1733eb49e49522a47de35a4edab1d195d200427014994128c0eaa899d45b1d3a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4aaacd9dd721e5835d8c9e7b3bc4fa2f9d18569d43bc5cd2417bf7a65a3f9ee0","logical_entry_identity":"f9349530c4813ad8f82053f43c031a7704085e4ae8cc6071a488c45e433759b5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Lay Warp Mines in a radius of 1 that teleport enemies to you and inflict %0.2f physical and %0.2f temporal (warp) damage.\n\t\tThe mines are hidden traps (%d detection and %d disarm power based on your Magic) and last for %d turns.\n\t\tThe damage caused by your Warp Mines will improve with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在半径 1 的范围内布设时空地雷，将敌人传送到你身边，并造成 %0.2f 物理伤害和 %0.2f 时空（扭曲）伤害。\n\t\t这些地雷是隐藏陷阱（侦测强度为 %d，解除强度为 %d，二者均取决于你的魔法属性），持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t时空地雷造成的伤害随法术强度提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5fa66d203cbd7501212d7cf16dcd119fef3a497c294dad384e8b1f2c57e1dfa5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4abac30e6f4f59080fd374a10c1c8c26d15ae2c3ab20e35be856afc6c9d1eec3","logical_entry_identity":"0f90c78ff1bedd4d688ad58a3fb35d7cddcd7a6242c9455da586ffe3b81681da","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Ambush","source_tag":"_t","target":"伏击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7ae2ca32073329f861d8ddcee0be28074546a67111dd3e96defb3941d4e05177","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4abc6e91a873d0d84f2b410bba8f5ca4ce1c33bdb23676238a59457e11ce2ae0","logical_entry_identity":"c1e3101105cf598358280772267737b7eff6735498a5cb895aa828f0adfc77dc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Thunderclap","source_tag":"talent name","target":"闪电霹雳"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d080ad362a642af98fbef4f87be610009a2ef70e10fc77b00131eb85d1c95060","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4abce21381fb37c58c3ce9bb15ce189ef940f87711b84f77e0aa3d5103d4616b","logical_entry_identity":"4d19b5f70d8a0c2932eb6fd34a8acf2c283dd40b29b415ae0457059f6c23c7b9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Abyssal Shroud","source_tag":"_t","target":"堕入深渊"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"235f584ec50e46a52b720c6ae1610b3c445b22530f4841c111d1903a768e7737","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4ac71d42716cd34f71b474a0ba8a31f91eb1da5e1298d66f8ce40bad3171d677","logical_entry_identity":"cc2ba08336613e3ce19ea8dd7621595f1b6e0ae8b81defe325e997e86655581a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Headbanged 20 bosses to death.","source_tag":"_t","target":"用头槌撞死了20个BOSS。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0fc75856bcd4d5e4220c0379ce8b9e131d07b2f491cbe033e69cadcb4460e313","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4ac7784aad3e6ddb858270a59a38e29f18fb86b4d2492da244920e5099fcda2c","logical_entry_identity":"6d0f04f8105c5fb0601d0e84120f10f8d36d083590cdc46977ace235591584d4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{italic}#Touching the conch makes it emit a sound. As you put it to your ear you hear a deep voice emanating from within:#{normal}#\n\n\"Waverider Tiamel reporting. Immediate perimeter is secure, though I have sent some members to scout the surrounding areas. I will feel better when we have mapped the land and are ready to sustain a larger team. Still, we should be perfectly safe as long as the landdwellers do not know of our presence. And even if they dare come here the magics of Zoisla will put their puny star worship to shame.\n\n\"I fear that some of the team are not taking our mission seriously. Do they not know the responsibility the Saviour has laid on us? We are his arms and tails in this far land, and it is our duty to protect the farportal which will help bring us to greater strengths. We are his first line of attack against the blood relatives of those who doomed our race so long ago. And with our efforts we shall push forward our race to new boundaries, laying the path for the bright future our great Saviour has planned for us. Long live Slasul! Long live the legend of the Devourer!\"","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#触摸这只海螺可以使它发出声音。当你将它放于耳边时，你听到了一阵低沉的声音从里面传出来：#{normal}#\n\n\"踏浪者塔米尔报告。据点周边已确保安全，不过我已派出几名队员侦察附近地带。等我们绘制好这片陆地的地图，并具备维持一支更大规模队伍的条件，我才会更加安心。只要陆地居民不知道我们的存在，我们应该就绝对安全。即便他们胆敢来到这里，佐西拉的魔法也会让他们那微不足道的星辰崇拜相形见绌。\n\n\"我担心队里有些人没有严肃对待我们的使命。难道他们不知道救世主赋予我们的责任吗？在这片遥远的土地上，我们就是他的手臂和尾巴；我们有责任守护那座远行传送门，它将为我们带来更强大的兵力。我们是他进攻那些很久以前毁掉我们种族之人血亲的先锋。凭借我们的努力，我们将带领种族开拓新的疆界，为伟大救世主替我们筹划的光明未来铺平道路。萨拉苏尔万岁！吞噬者的传说万岁！\""},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"68e2178b9a0e9b291a6d9bc178eef5210a725cf3497cce2c5692b3d2f32672eb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4ac8c83fa1cb689b589dda952ec00aaf0de3a1c358d41839a3dadc83965fb5ed","logical_entry_identity":"8a88d488d1956fab7fe3f37278c8ccb164a076b3a998137d679f4c54a5417c8f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This object's appearance was changed to %s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"这个物品的外观被改变为 %s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c50ecc548ee9f867d2ba3e1d9651cb419082b8a9ad3a9957512354217a97342b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4ac975213615fbd38bfc7b88021ddee27ed7eb6ead0caa5781fd77c8493979c2","logical_entry_identity":"9c632f4fe79af3496b9d602b45a52fc351eea2a53cc46f08660e4ced5aa8c365","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Can't be worn by those with arcane powers.","source_tag":"_t","target":"使用奥术力量的人无法穿戴。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"849b638676858be67e224eebd53ae1a3815c40540f7866b01ad3f8fb1510e21c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4ad08450138d12d3704902fbae285ff7de5ddcd6b0db917050a31a3fd74b0e85","logical_entry_identity":"15be71737725f2c918abfc9e6869466208462f7555b006bf6bb3fa611fdb4e01","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"mace smith","source_tag":"entity name","target":"铸锤师"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e37e6bedc524d7847f8c2c5b8f73904047de52c86db361e905c7cc528c47cb99","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4ad29a03fc5e464ce9fc6d52f6b27b323e51dd60018bfa1c316259c6a75b1589","logical_entry_identity":"137e233daae55f38d98c4d6b14fc4adff0afd956bac4522abe788a82b0fcfad2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The telekinetically-wielded mindstar has a %d%% chance to grab a foe up to %d range away.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"念动灵晶有 %d%% 几率抓取 %d 半径内的敌人。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7688acc4b51ca6a06797729d29aeeeb4464b08e8cf40e50948641b41fadad901","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4ad3985924f9a7492de52ce3d664198a9178165e8dfe4594c7e302bfd6452ba3","logical_entry_identity":"184daa99dfd27d16a48fff9900a6b866a6ef80969cd83cdb14320d84b63edaec","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#VIOLET#You enter the swirling portal and in the blink of an eye you are back in the lobby.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#VIOLET#你进入了传送漩涡，一眨眼功夫你回到了大厅。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c9a17437fad1451408e6734a87fbd0574b42a8e96fa31f30dfa03a8e7e3485ad","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4ad49c074dfe1dad9a532fe3dc948bd4619582d2b638cd012630e471efc91034","logical_entry_identity":"8cddc041844769fdaa820235c7aea8f735b19526a4b34256746dc3502e83430c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The diminutive skeleton of a giant rat, charged with evil energies. Nobody understands the usefulness of undead rodents until several of them come after you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一只被邪恶能量支配的巨大老鼠骨骼。在它们追赶你之前，没人知道亡灵啮齿动物的可怕。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}}